    "summary": "A self-hosted, open-source applicant tracking system for teams that want control over their hiring stack. > **Public beta.** Harly is intended for small, self-hosted teams while the > product and deployment workflows continue to mature. Review the [release > readiness guide](docs/release-readiness.md), test upgrades on a disposable > installation, and verify backups before importing real candidate data. What is Harly? Harly is a self-hostable ATS for startups, agencies, and technical teams. It"
